I think you have the problem with Model 2, which should be

Model2 <- 'X2 =~ EDS + GSD.GENERAL + GSD.VERBAL.ABUSES + GSD.PHYSICAL.ABUSES + GSD.SEXUAL.ABUSES

M2 =~ PRIDE + SHAME + PASSING + ALIENATION
Y2 =~ BAI + CESD

Y2 ~ c*X2
M2 ~ a*X2
Y2 ~ b*M2
ab := a*b
total := c + (a*b)
'

That is, you do not need PATH$ in the lavaan script.

