Okay. You have not fully changed the following lines as I suggested:

X <- 'PATH$EDS + PATH$GSD_GENERAL + PATH$GSD.VERBAL.ABUSES + PATH$GSD.PHYSICAL.ABUSES + PATH$GSD.SEXUAL.ABUSES'
M <- 'PATH$PRIDE + PATH$SHAME + PATH$PASSING + PATH$ALIENATION'
Y <- 'PATH$BAI + PATH$CESD'

Should be

PATH$X <- PATH$EDS + PATH$GSD_GENERAL + PATH$GSD.VERBAL.ABUSES + PATH$GSD.PHYSICAL.ABUSES + PATH$GSD.SEXUAL.ABUSES
PATH$M <- PATH$PRIDE + PATH$SHAME + PATH$PASSING + PATH$ALIENATION
PATH$Y <- PATH$BAI + PATH$CESD

That is why lavaan does not recognize the X, Y, and M in PATH.

