From u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com  Thu Sep  4 20:42:57 2014
From: u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com (Terrence Jorgensen)
Date: Thu, 04 Sep 2014 20:42:57 +0000
Subject: Re: DIF multiple groups: how can I equalize standardized loadings (instead of unstandardized loadings)?
Message-ID: <eRRgQwWrkt4.O6WSyhXwAPIJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <eRRgQwWrkt4.sLYUJTXwbXMJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
