library(lavaan)
HS.model1 <- '  visual =~ *NA*x1 + x2 + x3
              textual =~ NA*x4 + x5 + x6
              speed   =~ NA*x7 + x8 + x9
              visual~~1*visual
              textual~~1*textual
              speed~~1*speed'
fit1 <- cfa(HS.model1,
           data = HolzingerSwineford1939)
summary(fit1)

I summarize the loadings

                   Estimate  Std.err  Z-value  P(>|z|)
Latent variables:
  visual =~
    x1                0.900    0.081   11.127    0.000
