    x7                0.619    0.070    8.903    0.000
    x8                0.731    0.066   11.090    0.000
    x9                0.670    0.065   10.305    0.000

Here is what I want:
x1 should be -0.900
x4 should be -0.990
x7 should be -0.619

Any feedback would be helpful as I can fit this type of thing in Mplus version 7.

Thanks,

